{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52927","headline":"颂 一 · 拾得","name":"颂 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无瞋是持（《五灯会元》作「嗔即是」）戒，心净是（《五灯会元》作「即」）出家。\n我性与汝（《五灯会元》作「你」）合，一切法无差。\n（见吴越释延寿《宗镜录》卷二十四、宋普济《五灯会元》卷二。\n）（按：《全唐诗续补遗》卷二误收此首爲寒山诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"拾得","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}